# Helpers for the "two elevated suffixes + locked reforge for the prefixes" pattern.

# After an Awakener's Orb: make sure there is an open prefix for the
# "Suffixes Cannot Be Changed" metamod (which is itself a PREFIX).
# Uses "Add a Suffix, Remove a Random Prefix" if a suffix is open, else Orb of
# Annulment (which can hit one of the elevated suffixes: that risk is simulated).
def make_room_for_suffix_lock(mod_a, mod_b) {
    until open_prefix >= 1 or not has mod_a elevated or not has mod_b elevated {
        if open_suffix >= 1 { beastcraft add_suffix_remove_prefix } else { annul }
    }
    if open_prefix == 0 { fail "lost an elevated mod while making room for the metamod" }
}
